STX#1"COMMENT|CMT CM||0|0|||COMMENT|COMMENT|";
STX#1"SETPOS|SPOS STP||0|1|position bookkeeping that never affected the quantum state|egoera kuantikoan inoiz eraginik izan ez zuen posizio-erregistroa|SETPOS|SETPOS|";
STX#1"SETWL|SWL SW||0|1|wavelength bookkeeping that never affected the quantum state|egoera kuantikoan inoiz eraginik izan ez zuen uhin-luzera erregistroa|SETWL|SETWL|";
STX#1"WLSHIFT|WLS WLSH||0|1|wavelength bookkeeping that never affected the quantum state|egoera kuantikoan inoiz eraginik izan ez zuen uhin-luzera erregistroa|WLSHIFT|WLSHIFT|";
STX#1"MOVE|MV||0|1|position bookkeeping that never affected the quantum state|egoera kuantikoan inoiz eraginik izan ez zuen posizio-erregistroa|MOVE|MOVE|";
STX#1"MARKOBSERVED|MOBS MO||0|1|it had no effect; a measured qubit is simply measured|ez zuen eraginik; neurtutako qubit bat neurtuta dago, besterik ez|MARKOBSERVED|MARKOBSERVED|";
STX#1"RELEASE|REL RL||0|1|it had no effect; a simulator has nothing to release|ez zuen eraginik; simulagailu batek ez du ezer askatzeko|RELEASE|RELEASE|";
STX#1"DECOHERENCEPROTECT|DPROT DP||0|1|there is no physical model behind it; study decoherence with `qoa run --noise`|ez dago eredu fisikorik atzean; dekoherentzia aztertzeko erabili `qoa run --noise`|DECOHERENCEPROTECT|DECOHERENCEPROTECT|";
STX#1"ENTANGLESWAPMEASURE|ESWAPM ESM||0|1|use ESWAP, then branch on the measured bits with JUMPIFONE|erabili ESWAP, eta gero adarkatu neurtutako bitekin JUMPIFONE bidez|ENTANGLESWAPMEASURE|ENTANGLESWAPMEASURE|";
STX#1"ENTANGLEWITHCLASSICALFEEDBACK|EWCFB ECFB||0|1|use gates plus JUMPIFONE/IFEQ for classical feedback|erabili ateak eta JUMPIFONE/IFEQ atzeraelikadura klasikorako|ENTANGLEWITHCLASSICALFEEDBACK|ENTANGLEWITHCLASSICALFEEDBACK|";
STX#1"ENTANGLEDISTRIBUTED|EDIST ED||0|1|networked entanglement between machines is not modelled|makinen arteko sareko entrelazamendua ez dago modelatuta|ENTANGLEDISTRIBUTED|ENTANGLEDISTRIBUTED|";
STX#1"APPLYNONLINEARPHASESHIFT|ANLPS ANLP ANLPH||0|1|it was never defined; use KERR or CROSSKERR|ez zen inoiz definitu; erabili KERR edo CROSSKERR|APPLYNONLINEARPHASESHIFT|APPLYNONLINEARPHASESHIFT|";
STX#1"APPLYNONLINEARSIGMA|ANLS ANLSI||0|1|it was never defined; use KERR or CROSSKERR|ez zen inoiz definitu; erabili KERR edo CROSSKERR|APPLYNONLINEARSIGMA|APPLYNONLINEARSIGMA|";
STX#1"QUANTUMZENOEFFECT|QZE QZEN||0|1|it needs continuous-time evolution, which QOA does not model; repeated MEASURE in a LOOPSTART shows the freezing|denbora jarraituko bilakaera behar du, eta QOA-k ez du modelatzen; LOOPSTART baten barruko MEASURE errepikatuek izozte bera erakusten dute|QUANTUMZENOEFFECT|QUANTUMZENOEFFECT|";
STX#1"APPLYLINEAROPTICALTRANSFORM|ALOT ALOPT||0|1|build the network from BS and MODEPHASE; every linear optical unitary decomposes into them|eraiki sarea BS eta MODEPHASE erabiliz; unitario optiko lineal oro haietan deskonposatzen da|APPLYLINEAROPTICALTRANSFORM|APPLYLINEAROPTICALTRANSFORM|";
STX#1"ERRORCORRECT|ECORR EC||0|1|no error-correcting code was ever specified; write the correction circuit with gates|ez zen inoiz errore-zuzentzeko koderik zehaztu; idatzi zuzenketa-zirkuitua ateekin|ERRORCORRECT|ERRORCORRECT|";
STX#1"ERRORSYNDROME|ESYN ES||0|1|no code was ever specified; write the syndrome circuit with gates and MEASURE|ez zen inoiz koderik zehaztu; idatzi sindrome-zirkuitua ateekin eta MEASURE-rekin|ERRORSYNDROME|ERRORSYNDROME|";
STX#1"PHOTONROUTE|PROUTE PR||0|1|ports were never defined; use MODESWAP or BS|atakak ez ziren inoiz definitu; erabili MODESWAP edo BS|PHOTONROUTE|PHOTONROUTE|";
STX#1"TIMEDELAY|TDELAY TD||0|1|an ideal delay changes nothing; model a real one with LOSS and MODEPHASE|atzerapen ideal batek ez du ezer aldatzen; benetakoa modelatzeko erabili LOSS eta MODEPHASE|TIMEDELAY|TIMEDELAY|";
STX#1"OPTICALDELAYLINECONTROL|ODLC ODL||0|1|an ideal delay changes nothing; model a real one with LOSS and MODEPHASE|atzerapen ideal batek ez du ezer aldatzen; benetakoa modelatzeko erabili LOSS eta MODEPHASE|OPTICALDELAYLINECONTROL|OPTICALDELAYLINECONTROL|";
STX#1"WAIT|||0|1|an ideal wait changes nothing; use `qoa run --noise` to study idle errors|itxaronaldi ideal batek ez du ezer aldatzen; geldirik dauden erroreak aztertzeko erabili `qoa run --noise`|WAIT|WAIT|";
STX#1"PHOTONBUNCHINGCONTROL|PBUNCH PBC||0|1|bunching comes from interference (see BS), it is not a switch|multzokatzea interferentziatik dator (ikus BS), ez da etengailu bat|PHOTONBUNCHINGCONTROL|PHOTONBUNCHINGCONTROL|";
STX#1"SINGLEPHOTONSOURCEOFF|SPSOFF||0|1|sources are instantaneous (SINGLEPHOTON); there is nothing to switch off|iturriak berehalakoak dira (SINGLEPHOTON); ez dago ezer itzaltzeko|SINGLEPHOTONSOURCEOFF|SINGLEPHOTONSOURCEOFF|";
STX#1"APPLYDISPLACEMENTOPERATOR|ADO ADOP||0|1|use DISPLACE|erabili DISPLACE|APPLYDISPLACEMENTOPERATOR|APPLYDISPLACEMENTOPERATOR|";
STX#1"OPTICALSWITCHCONTROL|OSC OSW||0|1|use MODESWAP to switch|erabili MODESWAP aldatzeko|OPTICALSWITCHCONTROL|OPTICALSWITCHCONTROL|";
STX#1"MEASUREWITHDELAY|MWD MWDEL||0|1|an ideal delay changes nothing; use MEASURE|atzerapen ideal batek ez du ezer aldatzen; erabili MEASURE|MEASUREWITHDELAY|MEASUREWITHDELAY|";
STX#1"PHOTONLOSSCORRECTION|PLC PLCOR||0|1|no loss-correcting code was ever specified|ez zen inoiz galera zuzentzeko koderik zehaztu|PHOTONLOSSCORRECTION|PHOTONLOSSCORRECTION|";
STX#1"PHOTONEMISSIONPATTERN|PEPAT PEP||0|1|it was never defined; use EMIT inside LOOPSTART|ez zen inoiz definitu; erabili EMIT LOOPSTART baten barruan|PHOTONEMISSIONPATTERN|PHOTONEMISSIONPATTERN|";
STX#1"APPLYFEEDFORWARDGATE|AFFG||0|1|use JUMPIFONE or IFEQ to apply gates conditionally|erabili JUMPIFONE edo IFEQ ateak baldintzapean aplikatzeko|APPLYFEEDFORWARDGATE|APPLYFEEDFORWARDGATE|";
STX#1"THERMALAVG|||0|1|not a quantum-circuit operation|ez da zirkuitu kuantikoko eragiketa bat|THERMALAVG|THERMALAVG|";
STX#1"WKBFACTOR|||0|1|not a quantum-circuit operation|ez da zirkuitu kuantikoko eragiketa bat|WKBFACTOR|WKBFACTOR|";
STX#1"CMP|||0|1|IFEQ, IFNE, IFGT and IFLT compare registers directly|IFEQ, IFNE, IFGT eta IFLT aginduek erregistroak zuzenean konparatzen dituzte|CMP|CMP|";
STX#1"JMPABS|JMPA JABS||0|1|byte addresses no longer exist; jump to a label|byte-helbideak jada ez daude; jauzi etiketa batera|JMPABS|JMPABS|";
STX#1"CALLADDR|CADDR CA||0|1|byte addresses no longer exist; CALL a label|byte-helbideak jada ez daude; erabili CALL etiketa batekin|CALLADDR|CALLADDR|";
STX#1"LOADMEM|LMEM LM||0|1|memory is now LOAD dst addr, with the address in a register|memoria orain LOAD helmuga helbidea da, helbidea erregistro batean|LOADMEM|LOADMEM|";
STX#1"STOREMEM|SMEM SM||0|1|memory is now STORE src addr, with the address in a register|memoria orain STORE iturria helbidea da, helbidea erregistro batean|STOREMEM|STOREMEM|";
STX#1"LOADCLASSICAL|LCL LC||0|1|memory is now LOAD dst addr, with the address in a register|memoria orain LOAD helmuga helbidea da, helbidea erregistro batean|LOADCLASSICAL|LOADCLASSICAL|";
STX#1"STORECLASSICAL|SCL SC||0|1|memory is now STORE src addr, with the address in a register|memoria orain STORE iturria helbidea da, helbidea erregistro batean|STORECLASSICAL|STORECLASSICAL|";
STX#1"ALLOC|ALC||0|1|memory needs no allocation: LOAD and STORE use cells 0, 1, 2, ... directly|memoriak ez du esleipenik behar: LOAD eta STORE 0, 1, 2, ... gelaxkak zuzenean erabiltzen dituzte|ALLOC|ALLOC|";
STX#1"FREE|FRE||0|1|memory needs no freeing: LOAD and STORE use cells 0, 1, 2, ... directly|memoria ez da askatu behar: LOAD eta STORE 0, 1, 2, ... gelaxkak zuzenean erabiltzen dituzte|FREE|FREE|";
STX#1"BREAKPOINT|BP||0|1|use DUMPSTATE and DUMPREGS to look at a point in the program|erabili DUMPSTATE eta DUMPREGS programaren puntu bat ikusteko|BREAKPOINT|BREAKPOINT|";
STX#1"EXITCODE|EXC EX||0|1|use HALT|erabili HALT|EXITCODE|EXITCODE|";
STX#1"QUBITS|QUBIT||0|1|use QINIT with the qubit count, e.g. QINIT 25|erabili QINIT qubit-kopuruarekin, adib. QINIT 25|QUBITS|QUBITS|";
STX#1"QGATE|||0|1|use GATE name qubit, or the gate's own instruction|erabili GATE izena qubita, edo atearen agindu propioa|QGATE|QGATE|";
; @isa-end
STX#1"";
LXP@(#0)<=#1;
#0<=#2;
^;

; buildtext: agindu bakoitza zein eraikitzailek sortzen duen (eta haren parametroa), izen nagusiaren arabera.
; hau mihiztatzailearen logika da, ez src/isa.rs-eko datua: eraikitzaileak `build` atalean daude.
buildtext:
#0<=0;
#1<=LXP@(#0);
#2<=#1;
STX#1"H 1 0 X 1 1 Y 1 2 Z 1 3 S 1 4 SDG 1 5 T 1 6 TDG 1 7 SX 1 8 SXDG 1 9";
STX#1"PHASE 2 13 RX 2 10 RY 2 11 RZ 2 12 U 3 0 ROT 4 0 MROT 5 0 GATE 6 0";
STX#1"CNOT 7 1 CY 7 2 CH 7 0 CSX 7 8 CRX 8 10 CRY 8 11 CRZ 8 12 CU 9 0 CZ 10 0 CPHASE 10 1";
STX#1"SWAP 11 0 CSWAP 12 0 CCX 13 0 MCX 14 0 MCZ 15 0 BELL 16 0 GHZ 17 5 CLUSTER 17 6 ESWAP 18 0";
STX#1"MEASURE 19 0 MEASUREIN 20 0 MEASUREALL 21 9 RESETALL 21 11 DUMPSTATE 21 32 DUMPREGS 21 33";
STX#1"RETSUB 21 52 HALT 21 55 BARRIER 21 56";
STX#1"RESET 22 10 ADDPHOTON 22 27 SUBPHOTON 22 28 RAND 22 41 INPUT 22 43 GETTIME 22 44 PUSH 60 0";
STX#1"POP 22 46 CHAROUT 61 0 GETC 22 64 PUTC 62 0 GETLANG 22 68 ARGC 22 69";
STX#1"EMIT 23 13 DISPLACEREG 23 19 SQUEEZEREG 23 21 REGCOPY 57 0 LOAD 58 0 STORE 59 0 ARGBYTE 63 0";
STX#1"TOBASIS 25 0 DISPLACE 26 18 SQUEEZE 26 20 MODEPHASE 27 0 KERR 28 0 CROSSKERR 29 0 BS 29 1";
STX#1"MODESWAP 29 2 LOSS 30 0 FOCK 31 0 SINGLEPHOTON 32 0 COUNT 33 0 DETECT 34 15 PARITY 34 16";
STX#1"COINCIDENCE 35 0 DISPERSIVE 36 0 EXPECT 37 0 BELLCHECK 38 0 MEANPHOTON 39 0 REGSET 40 0";
STX#1"ADD 41 0 SUB 41 1 MUL 41 2 DIV 41 3 ANDBITS 41 4 ORBITS 41 5 XORBITS 41 6 SHL 41 7 SHR 41 8";
STX#1"POW 41 9 SQRT 42 0 EXP 42 1 LOG 42 2 NOTBITS 42 3 SIN 42 4 COS 42 5 TAN 42 6 SEEDRNG 43 0";
STX#1"CHARLOAD 44 0 PACKBITS 45 0 JUMP 46 48 CALL 46 51 JUMPIFZERO 47 0 JUMPIFONE 47 1";
STX#1"IFEQ 48 0 IFNE 48 1 IFGT 48 2 IFLT 48 3 LOOPSTART 49 0 LOOPEND 50 0 PRINT 51 0 PRINTLN 51 1";
STX#1"PRINTF 52 0 VERBOSELOG 53 0 STORETEXT 54 0 STREAM 55 0 EXIT 56 0";
STX#1"QINIT 99 1 QMODE 99 2 QREG 99 3 CREG 99 4 OREG 99 5 COMMENT 99 6 RREG 99 7 CONST 99 8";
STX#1"";
LXP@(#0)<=#1;
#0<=#2;
^;

; field: R0 = testuaren kurtsorea (byteak, 0-z amaitua) -> R0 = eremuaren hasiera, R1 = luzera, R2 = hurrengo
; eremuaren kurtsorea ('|' ondoren, edo 0-an geratzen da). aldatzen ditu R0-R4
field:
#2<=#0;
#4<=124;
field_next:
#3<=LXP@(#2);
IEQ#3,#30,field_end;
IEQ#3,#4,field_bar;
#2_+#31;
>field_next;
field_bar:
#1<=#2-#0;
#2_+#31;
^;
field_end:
#1<=#2-#0;
^;

; isaload: taula irakurri eta izen-taula bete; gero eraikitzaileak lotu
isaload:
PUSH#8;
PUSH#9;
PUSH#10;
PUSH#11;
PUSH#12;
PUSH#13;
PUSH#14;
; zehaztapenak: gehienez 512
#0<=12288;
&alloc;
#1<=8;
LXP@(#1)<=#0;
#10<=#0;
; izen-taula: 2048 zirrikitu
#0<=2048;
&alloc;
#1<=10;
LXP@(#1)<=#0;
#0<=2047;
#1<=11;
LXP@(#1)<=#0;
&isatext;
#8<=#0;
#9<=0;
isaload_rec:
#0<=LXP@(#8);
IEQ#0,#30,isaload_end;
#0<=24;
#11<=#9*#0;
#11<=#10+#11;
; 0 izena
#0<=#8;
&field;
LXP@(#11)<=#0;
#3<=#11+#31;
LXP@(#3)<=#1;
#12<=#2;
; 1 ezizenak: geroago (R13, R14 = testua)
#0<=#12;
&field;
#13<=#0;
#14<=#1;
#12<=#2;
; 2 eragigaiak
#0<=#12;
&field;
PUSH#2;
#2<=#11;
&operands;
POP#12;
; 3 hedapena, 4 kendua
#0<=#12;
&field;
#0<=LXP@(#0);
#3<=48;
#0-=>#3;
#3<=4;
#3<=#11+#3;
LXP@(#3)<=#0;
#12<=#2;
#0<=#12;
&field;
#0<=LXP@(#0);
#3<=48;
#0-=>#3;
#3<=5;
#3<=#11+#3;
LXP@(#3)<=#0;
#12<=#2;
; 5..8: arrazoiak eta erabilerak, 6. gelaxkatik aurrera bikoteka
#5<=6;
#5<=#11+#5;
*4{
#0<=#12;
&field;
LXP@(#5)<=#0;
#5_+#31;
LXP@(#5)<=#1;
#5_+#31;
#12<=#2;
}
; 9 izen labur leuna (0.4.5): agindu-lekuan bakarrik, izen-taulan zehaztapena negatiboan
#0<=#12;
&field;
PUSH#0;
PUSH#1;
#12<=#2;
; hurrengo erregistroa: 0aren ondoren
isaload_skip:
#0<=LXP@(#12);
IEQ#0,#30,isaload_next;
#12_+#31;
>isaload_skip;
isaload_next:
#8<=#12+#31;
; izena eta ezizenak izen-taulan
#0<=LXP@(#11);
#1<=#11+#31;
#1<=LXP@(#1);
#2<=#11;
&mnput;
#0<=#13;
#1<=#14;
#2<=#11;
&aliases;
POP#1;
POP#0;
IEQ#1,#30,isaload_nosoft;
#2<=#30-#11;
&mnput;
isaload_nosoft:
#9_+#31;
>isaload_rec;
isaload_end:
#0<=9;
LXP@(#0)<=#9;
&builders;
POP#14;
POP#13;
POP#12;
POP#11;
POP#10;
POP#9;
POP#8;
^;

; mnput: R0, R1 = izena, R2 = zehaztapena -> izen-taulan (izen bera berriz agertzen bada, azkenak irabazten du,
; rust-en HashMap::insert bezala). aldatzen ditu R0-R7
mnput:
PUSH#8;
PUSH#9;
PUSH#10;
#8<=#0;
#9<=#1;
#10<=#2;
#0<=10;
#0<=LXP@(#0);
#1<=#8;
#2<=#9;
#3<=2047;
&htfind;
IEQ#1,#30,mnput_new;
#1_+#31;
#1_+#31;
LXP@(#1)<=#10;
>mnput_done;
mnput_new:
#4<=#0;
#0<=3;
PUSH#4;
&alloc;
POP#4;
LXP@(#0)<=#8;
#1<=#0+#31;
LXP@(#1)<=#9;
#1_+#31;
LXP@(#1)<=#10;
LXP@(#4)<=#0;
mnput_done:
POP#10;
POP#9;
POP#8;
^;

; aliases: R0, R1 = hutsunez bereizitako ezizenak, R2 = zehaztapena -> zerrenda (16-17) eta izen-taula
aliases:
PUSH#8;
PUSH#9;
PUSH#10;
PUSH#11;
PUSH#12;
#8<=#0;
#9<=#0+#1;
#10<=#2;
; gehienez luzera/2 + 1 ezizen
#0<=#1;
#0_+#31;
&alloc;
#1<=16;
#1<=#10+#1;
LXP@(#1)<=#0;
#11<=#0;
#12<=0;
aliases_next:
IEQ#8,#9,aliases_done;
#0<=LXP@(#8);
#1<=32;
INE#0,#1,aliases_word;
#8_+#31;
>aliases_next;
aliases_word:
#3<=#8;
aliases_scan:
IEQ#8,#9,aliases_got;
#0<=LXP@(#8);
#1<=32;
IEQ#0,#1,aliases_got;
#8_+#31;
>aliases_scan;
aliases_got:
#0<=2;
#0<=#12*#0;
#0<=#11+#0;
LXP@(#0)<=#3;
#1<=#8-#3;
#0_+#31;
LXP@(#0)<=#1;
#12_+#31;
#0<=#3;
#2<=#10;
&mnput;
>aliases_next;
aliases_done:
#1<=17;
#1<=#10+#1;
LXP@(#1)<=#12;
POP#12;
POP#11;
POP#10;
POP#9;
POP#8;
^;

; operands: R0, R1 = "q:control q:target" bezalako testua, R2 = zehaztapena -> eragigai-zerrenda (2-3)
operands:
PUSH#8;
PUSH#9;
PUSH#10;
PUSH#11;
PUSH#12;
#8<=#0;
